<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0"><dict>
  <key>Label</key><string>com.gascity.supervisor-restart-watchdog</string>

  <!-- Restart counter (ga-b0gltl) + fd guard (ga-xuo89c): com.gascity.supervisor
       dies periodically and launchd's KeepAlive silently respawns it, so the
       crash never surfaces as a visible failure — only as an unattributed
       dispatch gap. This job takes ONE sample per invocation (`launchctl
       print`), diffs the `runs` counter against the previous sample, and
       appends one JSONL record to .gc/logs/supervisor-restart-watchdog.jsonl
       with the delta and, when there is one, a reason (non-zero exit code,
       or an OS_REASON_*/codesign match in the bytes of supervisor.log
       appended since the previous sample).
       The counter half never touches the supervisor. The one exception is the
       fd guard (ga-xuo89c, stop-gap for the engine's fsnotify watch leak
       ga-0ox5tq): each sample also counts the supervisor's open fds with
       `lsof -n -P -p <pid>` (the `fds` field). Above 30,000 it only records;
       above 40,000 it runs `launchctl kickstart -k gui/<uid>/com.gascity.
       supervisor`, notifies at priority 4 and does not restart again for 30
       minutes. The city's tmux server runs outside the supervisor's process
       group (seen 2026-10-13), so its sessions should survive; the record's
       sessions_before/sessions_after are the proof on the first real event. A count it could not read is `fds:null`
       and never restarts anything. The lsof walk is what a run costs now: 0.65s
       at 900 fds, growing with the count (bounded at 120s in the script), so
       a run is still far inside StartInterval=900. Single-instance-locked
       (ga-y0g5x pattern), so a slow run can never stack concurrent instances.
       The PATH below carries /opt/homebrew/bin (timeout, tmux), /usr/sbin
       (lsof) and ~/.local/bin (notify). -->
  <key>ProgramArguments</key><array>
    <string>/bin/bash</string>
    <string>/Users/athos/gt/.gascity-gastown-hq/scripts/supervisor-restart-watchdog.sh</string>
  </array>

  <key>WorkingDirectory</key><string>/Users/athos/gt/.gascity-gastown-hq</string>
  <key>StartInterval</key><integer>900</integer>
  <key>RunAtLoad</key><true/>
  <key>LowPriorityIO</key><true/>
  <key>Nice</key><integer>10</integer>

  <key>StandardOutPath</key><string>/Users/athos/gt/.gascity-gastown-hq/.gc/logs/supervisor-restart-watchdog-launchd.out</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key><string>/Users/athos/gt/.gascity-gastown-hq/.gc/logs/supervisor-restart-watchdog-launchd.err</string>

  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key><dict>
    <key>PATH</key><string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin:/Users/athos/go/bin:/Users/athos/.local/bin</string>
    <key>HOME</key><string>/Users/athos</string>
  </dict>
</dict></plist>
